{"t":"BBY","made":"2026-11-07 10:12","name":"Best Buy Co., Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Specialty Retail","employees":82000,"hq":"Richfield, MN, United States","website":"https://corporate.bestbuy.com","summary_en":"Best Buy Co., Inc. offers technology products and solutions in the United States, Canada, and internationally. The company provides computing and mobile phone products, such as desktops, notebooks, and peripherals; mobile phones comprising related mobile network carrier commissions; networking products; tablets covering e-readers; smartwatches; and consumer electronics consisting of digital imaging, health and fitness products, portable audio comprising headphones and portable speakers, and smart home products, as well as home theaters that includes home theater accessories, soundbars, and televisions. It also offers appliances, such as dishwashers, laundry, ovens, refrigerators, blenders, coffee makers, vacuums, and personal care; entertainment products consisting of drones, peripherals, gaming, toys, and virtual reality, as well as hardware and software, and augmented reality glasses and other software products; and other products, such as baby, food and beverage, luggage, and outdoor living products. In addition, the company provides delivery, installation, marketplace commissions, memberships, repair, set-up, technical support, health-related, and warranty-related services. It offers its products through stores and websites under the Best Buy, Best Buy Ads, Best Buy Business, Best Buy Essentials, Best Buy Health, Best Buy Marketplace, Geek Squad, Imagine That, Insignia, Lively, Jitterbug, My Best Buy, My Best Buy Memberships, Pacific Kitchen, Home, TechLiquidators, and Yardbird brand names, as well as domain names comprising bestbuy.com, lively.com, techliquidators.com, yardbird.com, bestbuy.ca, and techliquidators.ca. The company was formerly known as Sound of Music, Inc. Best Buy Co., Inc. was incorporated in 1966 and is headquartered in Richfield, Minnesota.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Best Buy Co., Inc.는 미국, 캐나다 및 국제적으로 기술 제품과 솔루션을 제공합니다. 회사는 데스크톱, 노트북, 주변기기 등 컴퓨팅 및 휴대폰 제품을 제공합니다. 관련 모바일 네트워크 통신업체 수수료로 구성된 휴대폰; 네트워킹 제품; e-리더를 덮는 태블릿; 스마트워치; 디지털 이미징, 건강 및 피트니스 제품, 헤드폰과 휴대용 스피커로 구성된 휴대용 오디오, 스마트 홈 제품으로 구성된 가전 제품뿐만 아니라 홈 시어터 액세서리, 사운드바 및 TV를 포함하는 홈 시어터도 포함됩니다. 또한 식기세척기, 세탁실, 오븐, 냉장고, 믹서기, 커피 메이커, 진공청소기, 개인 위생용품 등의 가전제품도 제공합니다. 드론, 주변기기, 게임, 장난감, 가상 현실, 하드웨어 및 소프트웨어, 증강 현실 안경 및 기타 소프트웨어 제품으로 구성된 엔터테인먼트 제품; 유아용, 식품 및 음료, 수하물, 야외 생활용품 등 기타 제품. 또한 회사는 배송, 설치, 마켓플레이스 수수료, 멤버십, 수리, 설정, 기술 지원, 건강 관련 및 보증 관련 서비스를 제공합니다. Best Buy, Best Buy Ads, Best Buy Business, Best Buy Essentials, Best Buy Health, Best Buy Marketplace, Geek Squad, Imagine That, Insignia, Lively, Jitterbug, My Best Buy, My Best Buy Memberships, Pacific Kitchen, Home, TechLiquidators 및 Yardbird 브랜드 이름과 bestbuy.com, lively.com, techliquidators.com, yardbird.com으로 구성된 도메인 이름으로 매장과 웹사이트를 통해 제품을 제공합니다. bestbuy.ca 및 techliquidators.ca. 이 회사는 이전에 Sound of Music, Inc.로 알려져 있었습니다. Best Buy Co., Inc.는 1966년에 설립되었으며 미네소타 주 리치필드에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":99.63,"mcap":20895170560.0,"pe":16.57737,"fpe":13.79636,"peg":1.7662,"ps":0.49513447,"pb":6.5858006,"ev_ebitda":8.643,"div":3.86,"beta":1.208,"hi52":103.54,"lo52":55.1},"fin":{"rev":42201001984.0,"rev_g":0.036,"eps_g":0.701,"gross":0.22597,"op":0.03896,"net":0.03014,"roe":0.43126,"fcf":1403374976.0,"cash":2409999872.0,"debt":4140999936.0,"de":130.097,"eps":6.01,"feps":7.22147},"own":{"short":0.089099996,"inst":0.96333003,"insider":0.06521},"analyst":{"n":20,"mean":87.85,"median":86.5,"high":100.0,"low":71.0,"rec":"hold","recMean":2.8,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":0,"buy":4,"hold":19,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":0,"buy":4,"hold":19,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":0,"buy":4,"hold":19,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":0,"buy":5,"hold":18,"sell":1,"strongSell":1}]},"c